OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FThe family of a father who was stabbed
OL,8,Fto death by a violent offender on
OL,9,Fprobation are campaigning for a review
OL,10,Fof the Probation Service.
OL,12,FMichael Hoolickin, from Middleton, was
OL,13,Fstabbed after stepping in to defend a
OL,14,Fwoman in a pub. He died in hospital
OL,15,Fthree days later.
OL,17,FThe 27-year-old father was murdered by
OL,18,Fa violent offender, Timothy Deakin,
OL,19,Fwho was on probation after being
OL,20,Freleased on licence.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
