OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FGarry Hoolickin, Michael's father,
OL,8,Fsaid: "In the murder case the judge
OL,9,Flikened him to feral.
OL,11,F"He bit someone's ear off in an
OL,12,Funprovoked attack, he got I think it
OL,13,Fwas six years.
OL,15,F"Served less than half of it, came out
OL,16,Fin the February and in the October
OL,17,Fkilled my son.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36903
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,F"But every week, every month he should
OL,8,Fhave been recalled on numerous
OL,9,Foccasions. I think we got a figure of
OL,10,F51 times he should have been recalled."
OL,12,FThe failings of the Probation Service
OL,13,Fwere revealed at an inquest into
OL,14,FMichael's death in 2019, and the
OL,15,Fcoroner said the missed opportunity to
OL,16,Frecall Deakin probably contributed to
OL,17,FMichael's death.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36904
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FMichael's mother, Lesley, said: "Even
OL,8,Fif they had recalled him in the
OL,9,FSeptember of 2016 Michael would still
OL,10,Fbe here."
OL,12,FHis family have set up a campaign
OL,13,Fgroup called VOICE with other bereaved
OL,14,Ffamilies.
OL,16,FThe VOICE campaign was launched in
OL,17,FWestminster last year with Andy
OL,18,FBurnham joining the families to lend
OL,19,Fhis support.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36905
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FGarry said: "We got a group together,
OL,8,Fwent down to Andy Burnham's office and
OL,9,FI think there was 12 at the time.
OL,11,F"Andy could not believe the stories
OL,12,Fthat he was listening to.
OL,14,F"The loved ones have been killed
OL,15,Funnecessarily basically because they'd
OL,16,Fnot been recalling these criminals.
OL,17,FSome of them in the same boat as us,
OL,18,F30 and 40 times should have been
OL,19,Frecalled and gone on to murder."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36906
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FThe families say the latest figures
OL,8,Ffor Serious Further Offences (SFOs) by
OL,9,Foffenders released on licence show a
OL,10,Fneed to reform the Probation Service.
OL,12,FThere were 872 SFO notifications in
OL,13,F2024-25, up from 770 the previous year
OL,14,Fand 579 the year before.
OL,16,FLesley and Garry say they're
OL,17,Fcampaigning in Michael's memory to
OL,18,Fhelp prevent other families suffering
OL,19,Fthe loss that they have experienced.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G6/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36907
SC,0007
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FThey are asking the new Prime Minister
OL,8,Fto order an independent review of the
OL,9,FProbation Service.
OL,11,FGarry said: "We know he's got a lot to
OL,12,Fdo. But he's promised me, he's
OL,13,Fpromised Lesley, and he's promised all
OL,14,Fthese families that he's going to be
OL,15,Fwith us.
OL,17,F"Please support this campaign because
OL,18,Fit needs big change. I think he's
OL,19,Fgoing to change this probation system,
OL,20,Fand that's what we're hoping for."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G7/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36908
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FA Ministry of Justice spokesperson
OL,8,Fsaid their thoughts are with Michael's
OL,9,Ffamily. They added: "While rare, we
OL,10,Fknow it is devastating for victims and
OL,11,Ftheir loved ones when people
OL,12,Fsupervised by probation go on to
OL,13,Fcommit serious offences.
OL,15,F"The perpetrators responsible face the
OL,16,Ffull force of the law, and we carry
OL,17,Fout a thorough review of supervision
OL,18,Fwhere a probation manager meets with
OL,19,Floved ones to explain and apologise
OL,20,Ffor any failures.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G8/9
OL,2,W/*%+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
