OL,24,ANext Page BNW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,370,360,120,260,000,100
PN,36909
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F369A1785944890
OL,3,CFamily of man stabbed by person out on
OL,4,Clicence call for Probation Service
OL,5,Creview
OL,7,FThe MOJ went on to say it's putting a
OL,8,Frecord extra #700m investment into the
OL,9,Fprobation service and updating the
OL,10,Fsupport and treatments victims should
OL,11,Fexpect.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G9/9
